### 关键命令

1. apt install: `sudo apt-get install -y gcc-riscv64-unknown-elf device-tree-compiler libfdt-dev`
2. sail-riscv 下载: `curl -L -o sail-riscv-Linux-x86_64.tar.gz https://github.com/rems-project/sail-riscv/releases/download/0.12/sail-riscv-Linux-x86_64.tar.gz`
3. sail-riscv 链接: `sudo ln -sf /workspace/project/ChipForge/sail-riscv-Linux-x86_64/bin/sail_riscv_sim /usr/local/bin/sail_riscv`
4. riscof 安装: `pip3 install --index-url http://mirrors.cloud.aliyuncs.com/pypi/simple/ --trusted-host mirrors.cloud.aliyuncs.com riscof`
5. spike source: `curl -L -o spike-master.tar.gz https://codeload.github.com/riscv-software-src/riscv-isa-sim/tar.gz/refs/heads/master`
6. spike build: `cd riscv-isa-sim-master && mkdir build && cd build && ../configure --prefix=/opt/riscv-tools/spike && make -j2`

